{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_014aMufsYbiukTGyiaukd3Jw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Looking at the experiment plan and the worst-tier definition, I'll construct the detailed imagined data.\n\n```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  α_eff 约束有害——保留了 detector 误判的 borderline 样本，ESS-only 的 max-intervention 反而更优。\n  论文 pivot 为 empirical study：ESS-only adaptive b* 为主方法，α_eff 质量下界作为 negative finding，\n  τ sensitivity 作为 negative evidence。Claim 2 保留（ESS-only 也免调参），Claim 3 弱化。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  # ============================================================\n  # 已完成实验（锚定真实数据）\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Uniform baselines × 3 seeds\"\n    plan_id: \"mvp_uniform\"\n    description: \"ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, 200M tokens, 3 seeds uniform training\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_seed42: 17.690\n      eval_ppl_seed123: 17.690\n      eval_ppl_seed456: 17.700\n      seed_variance: 0.005\n    result_rationale: \"真实数据，已完成。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Uniform baseline 建立。三 seed PPL 极度一致（std=0.005），说明 seed variance 很小，后续实验间 0.01 级差异即有意义。\"\n\n  - name: \"Grid-b sweep seed42 (b=0.5/1.0/1.5/2.0/3.0/5.0)\"\n    plan_id: \"mvp_grid_b_seed42\"\n    description: \"固定 b 值 grid search，seed42\"\n    expected_results:\n      b0_5_eval_ppl: 17.651\n      b1_0_eval_ppl: 17.692\n      b1_5_eval_ppl: 17.718\n      b2_0_eval_ppl: 17.741\n      b3_0_eval_ppl: 17.774\n      b5_0_eval_ppl: 17.818\n      best_b: 0.5\n    result_rationale: \"真实数据，已完成。b=0.5 最优，PPL 随 b 单调递增。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Grid-best 在 b=0.5，说明轻度 downweighting 最优。b 越大 PPL 越差——过度 downweighting 丢失有效信息。\"\n\n  - name: \"Adaptive_fix × 3 seeds (n_min=2, τ=0.8)\"\n    plan_id: \"mvp_adaptive_fix\"\n    description: \"Dual-constraint adaptive b*, 3 seeds\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_seed42: 17.650\n      eval_ppl_seed123: 17.643\n      eval_ppl_seed456: 17.660\n      b_star_mean: 1.40\n      mvp_ratio_aggregate: 88.6\n    result_rationale: \"真实数据，已完成。Adaptive 在 seed42/456 接近 grid-best，seed123 稍逊于 grid-best(17.638)。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Claim 2 通过 Path B。但 adaptive b* mean=1.4 远高于 grid-best b=0.5，说明 adaptive 倾向于 under-downweight（α_eff binding 时 b* 仅 1.67）。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # RUNNING / PLANNED 实验——worst 档预测\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"ESS-only adaptive baseline (seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_ess_only_baseline\"\n    description: \"max{b : ESS≥n_min}，无 α_eff 约束，seed42\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.635\n      b_star_mean: 4.15\n      b_star_median: 3.20\n      ess_mean: 2.05\n      pct_b_zero: 49.9\n      delta_vs_dual: -0.015\n    result_rationale: >\n      ESS-only 选择 max{b : ESS≥n_min}，在 α_eff binding 的 ~40% reweighted batches 中，\n      b* 从 dual 的 1.67 跳到 4.15（2.5×）。这意味着对 synthetic 样本施加更激进的 downweight。\n      在 worst 档下，detector AUC=0.939 的 q-score 噪声使得 α_eff 阈值化保留的 \"borderline\" \n      样本实际质量可疑——这些样本 q ∈ [0.3, 0.5]，detector 不确定它们是否 synthetic，但 α_eff \n      约束强制保留它们（因为 b* 被压低以满足 α_eff≥τ）。ESS-only 直接把这些可疑样本大幅降权，\n      反而避免了 noisy borderline 样本对梯度的干扰。PPL 17.635 优于 dual 的 17.650，差值 0.015 \n      超过 seed variance（~0.005），形成统计可辨别的差异。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"ESS-only vs Dual head-to-head (seed42)\"\n        headers: [\"Method\", \"eval_ppl\", \"b*_mean\", \"ESS_mean\", \"Δ vs uniform\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Uniform\", 17.690, \"—\", \"—\", \"0.000\"]\n          - [\"Grid-best (b=0.5)\", 17.651, 0.5, \"—\", \"-0.039\"]\n          - [\"Dual (α_eff+ESS)\", 17.650, 1.40, 2.60, \"-0.040\"]\n          - [\"ESS-only\", 17.635, 4.15, 2.05, \"-0.055\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"b* 分布对比直方图：dual 集中在 [0.5, 2.0]，ESS-only 呈双峰分布（b*=0 和 b*∈[3,6]），说明 ESS-only 对 contaminated batch 施加更激进干预\"\n    analysis: >\n      ESS-only 明确优于 dual，差值 0.015 约为 seed variance 的 3 倍。核心原因：AUC=0.939 的 detector \n      在 borderline 区域（q ∈ [0.3, 0.5]）有大量误判，α_eff 约束迫使 b* 降低以保留这些样本的有效权重，\n      但这些样本中相当一部分实际是 synthetic。ESS-only 的 max-intervention 策略绕过了这个问题——\n      直接最大化 downweight 力度到 ESS 允许的极限。min-intervention principle 在 detector \n      calibration 不完美时适得其反。\n\n  - name: \"τ sweep (τ=0.5/0.6/0.7/0.8/0.9)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_tau_sweep\"\n    description: \"τ sensitivity 分析，seed42，ρ=0.4\"\n    expected_results:\n      tau_05_eval_ppl: 17.640\n      tau_06_eval_ppl: 17.644\n      tau_07_eval_ppl: 17.648\n      tau_08_eval_ppl: 17.650\n      tau_09_eval_ppl: 17.680\n      ppl_range: 0.040\n      ppl_std: 0.015\n      tau_095_eval_ppl: 17.800\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 worst 档下，τ sweep 暴露高度敏感性。τ 越低，α_eff 约束越宽松，b* 越大（趋近 ESS-only），\n      PPL 越好——这直接说明 α_eff 约束是有害的，放松它反而改善性能。τ=0.5 接近 ESS-only 效果\n      （α_eff 约束几乎不 binding），PPL 17.640 接近 ESS-only 的 17.635。τ=0.9 时约束过紧，\n      大量 batch 的 b* 被压到很低值，大量 noisy 样本被保留，PPL 恶化到 17.680。\n      τ=0.95 极端情况下几乎所有 batch 都被 α_eff 约束主导，b* 接近 0，PPL 退化到 17.800。\n      PPL 随 τ 单调递增（无 plateau），range=0.040 >> seed variance（0.005），std=0.015 >> \n      pass criteria 的 0.05 threshold。无 robust region——τ 选择直接决定性能，违背 Claim 3 的\n      \"any reasonable τ works\" 论断。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"τ sweep results (seed42, ρ=0.4)\"\n        headers: [\"τ\", \"eval_ppl\", \"Δ vs τ=0.8\", \"pct α_eff binding\", \"b*_mean\"]\n        rows:\n          - [0.50, 17.640, -0.010, \"5%\", 3.80]\n          - [0.60, 17.644, -0.006, \"12%\", 3.20]\n          - [0.70, 17.648, -0.002, \"25%\", 2.30]\n          - [0.80, 17.650, \"0.000 (ref)\", \"40%\", 1.40]\n          - [0.90, 17.680, +0.030, \"68%\", 0.65]\n          - [0.95, 17.800, +0.150, \"89%\", 0.15]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"τ vs eval_ppl 折线图：单调递增，无 plateau，低 τ 趋近 ESS-only 性能\"\n      - \"τ vs pct_alpha_binding 柱状图：从 5%(τ=0.5) 到 89%(τ=0.95)，α_eff 约束从几乎无到完全主导\"\n    analysis: >\n      τ sweep 是 worst 档的核心证据。PPL 随 τ 单调递增、无 plateau，说明 α_eff 约束越紧性能越差。\n      最优 τ 是尽量低（约束不 binding），等价于放弃 α_eff 约束。这从根本上削弱了 dual-constraint \n      框架——如果最优策略是让 α_eff 不 binding，那 α_eff 就不应该存在于方法中。\n      Claim 3 受到严重挑战：τ 不是 \"insensitive hyperparameter\"，而是决定方法质量的关键参数，\n      且最优方向是消除 α_eff 约束本身。\n\n  - name: \"Golden Ratio oracle baseline (seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_golden_ratio_baseline\"\n    description: \"w=1/φ≈0.618 for synthetic, 1.0 for real，已知比例 oracle\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.625\n      delta_vs_adaptive: -0.025\n      delta_vs_ess_only: -0.010\n      delta_vs_uniform: -0.065\n    result_rationale: >\n      Golden Ratio 使用已知比例 k 推导理论最优权重 w*=1/φ，且直接使用 ground truth label \n      区分 real/synthetic（不依赖 noisy detector）。在 worst 档下，它明确优于 adaptive（差值 0.025）\n      和 ESS-only（差值 0.010）。这说明：(1) 已知比例确实 matters——Claim 3 \"unknown proportion\" \n      的 setting 虽然实际重要，但确实牺牲了性能；(2) detector noise 是 adaptive 方法的瓶颈——\n      即使 ESS-only 绕过了 α_eff 的 borderline 保留问题，detector 的 q-score 误差仍然限制了\n      reweighting 质量；(3) adaptive（dual 或 ESS-only）与 oracle 的差距 0.01-0.025 虽不大，\n      但在 seed variance=0.005 的背景下是可辨别的。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"All methods comparison (seed42, ρ=0.4)\"\n        headers: [\"Method\", \"eval_ppl\", \"Δ vs uniform\", \"需要已知比例?\", \"需要 validation?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Uniform\", 17.690, \"—\", \"No\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"Grid-best (b=0.5)\", 17.651, -0.039, \"No\", \"Yes (grid search)\"]\n          - [\"Dual adaptive (τ=0.8)\", 17.650, -0.040, \"No\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"ESS-only adaptive\", 17.635, -0.055, \"No\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"Golden Ratio oracle\", 17.625, -0.065, \"Yes\", \"No\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Methods ranking bar chart：Golden Ratio > ESS-only > Grid-best ≈ Dual > Uniform\"\n    analysis: >\n      Golden Ratio oracle 明确优于所有 adaptive 方法，gap 可辨别。Claim 3 核心未被否定\n      （方法确实不需要已知比例即可运行），但 negative finding 是 proportion knowledge \n      确实提供性能优势。论文需诚实讨论这个 trade-off。\n\n  - name: \"n_min=1 ablation (seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_nmin_1\"\n    description: \"ESS 约束极度宽松（n_min=1），几乎无 ESS 约束\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.632\n      b_star_mean: 6.80\n      b_star_median: 5.20\n      ess_mean: 1.30\n      pct_ess_binding: 15\n      pct_alpha_binding: 60\n    result_rationale: >\n      n_min=1 使 ESS 约束极度宽松（batch_size=4 时 ESS≥1 几乎总能满足），b* 主要由 α_eff \n      约束决定。在 worst 档下，n_min=1 反而更优（17.632 vs dual n_min=2 的 17.650），\n      因为更宽松的 ESS 约束允许更激进的 downweighting。这与 ESS-only 的 finding 一致——\n      更多 downweighting = 更好。n_min=1 甚至接近 ESS-only（17.635），因为虽然 α_eff 仍 binding，\n      但 ESS 约束几乎不起作用，b* 能达到更高值。这个结果直接矛盾 dual-constraint 的 \"保守干预\" \n      逻辑——ESS 约束应该提供\"稳定上界\"防止 over-downweight，但放松它反而更好。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"n_min sensitivity (seed42, ρ=0.4)\"\n        headers: [\"n_min\", \"eval_ppl\", \"b*_mean\", \"ESS_mean\", \"行为\"]\n        rows:\n          - [1, 17.632, 6.80, 1.30, \"几乎无 ESS 约束，接近 max-b\"]\n          - [2, 17.650, 1.40, 2.60, \"Dual default，α_eff binding 40%\"]\n          - [3, 17.690, 0.30, 3.50, \"ESS 过紧，b* 被钳制，≈uniform\"]\n          - [\"ESS-only(n_min=2)\", 17.635, 4.15, 2.05, \"无 α_eff，max intervention\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"n_min vs eval_ppl 折线图：单调递增——n_min 越小（约束越松、b*越大）PPL 越好\"\n    analysis: >\n      n_min=1 优于 n_min=2，说明 ESS 约束也是有害的（在当前 batch_size=4 的设置下）。\n      更宽松约束 → 更大 b* → 更多 downweight → 更好 PPL。这与 dual-constraint 的 min-intervention \n      原则根本矛盾。论文需 pivot：ESS 约束的 n_min 不应追求 \"适度保守\"，而应尽量宽松。\n\n  - name: \"Grid-b low (b=0.1/0.2/0.3) × 3 seeds\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_grid_b_low_seed42\"\n    description: \"探索 b<0.5 区域是否有更优 grid-best\"\n    expected_results:\n      b0_1_eval_ppl_seed42: 17.680\n      b0_2_eval_ppl_seed42: 17.668\n      b0_3_eval_ppl_seed42: 17.658\n      b0_1_eval_ppl_seed123: 17.675\n      b0_2_eval_ppl_seed123: 17.660\n      b0_3_eval_ppl_seed123: 17.648\n      b0_1_eval_ppl_seed456: 17.685\n      b0_2_eval_ppl_seed456: 17.672\n      b0_3_eval_ppl_seed456: 17.660\n    result_rationale: >\n      b<0.5 区域应延续 grid sweep 的单调趋势：b 越小 PPL 越接近 uniform。b=0.3 约在 b=0.5(17.651) \n      和 uniform(17.690) 之间。b=0.5 仍是 grid-best，但 b=0.3 差距不大。\n      在 worst 档下这个实验的意义是：grid-best b=0.5 得到确认，adaptive b*_mean=1.40 远高于 \n      grid-best 0.5，但 ESS-only b*_mean=4.15 也远高于 grid-best 却表现更好——说明 batch-adaptive \n      的动态 b* 与 fixed b 的效果不能简单通过 mean b* 比较，per-batch 自适应本身有价值。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Extended grid-b curve (seed42)\"\n        headers: [\"b\", \"eval_ppl\", \"Δ vs uniform\"]\n        rows:\n          - [0.0, 17.690, \"0.000 (uniform)\"]\n          - [0.1, 17.680, -0.010]\n          - [0.2, 17.668, -0.022]\n          - [0.3, 17.658, -0.032]\n          - [0.5, 17.651, -0.039]\n          - [1.0, 17.692, +0.002]\n          - [1.5, 17.718, +0.028]\n          - [2.0, 17.741, +0.051]\n          - [3.0, 17.774, +0.084]\n          - [5.0, 17.818, +0.128]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"完整 grid-b 曲线（b=0.1 到 5.0）：U 型但不对称，最优在 b=0.5，右侧陡峭上升\"\n    analysis: >\n      b=0.5 确认为 grid-best。b=0.3 也不差（-0.032 vs uniform），说明 b 在 [0.3, 0.5] 区间 \n      都有效。关键对比：fixed b=0.5 (PPL=17.651) vs ESS-only adaptive (PPL=17.635)——\n      per-batch 自适应带来额外 0.016 改善，证明 adaptive b* 的价值（不论 dual 还是 ESS-only）。\n\n  - name: \"ρ=0.6 数据生成\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_contamination_60_datagen\"\n    description: \"60% 污染率数据集\"\n    expected_results:\n      total_tokens: 200000000\n      contamination_ratio: 0.6\n      scored_data_ready: true\n    result_rationale: \"数据生成是确定性步骤，无需预测。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"数据准备就绪。\"\n\n  - name: \"ρ=0.6 Uniform baseline (seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_contamination_60_uniform\"\n    description: \"60% 污染下的 uniform baseline\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 18.80\n    result_rationale: >\n      60% 污染比 40% 多 50% 的 synthetic 数据。Uniform baseline PPL 从 17.69(ρ=0.4) \n      上升到约 18.80，因为更多低质量 synthetic 样本拉低了整体训练质量。\n      PPL 跳跃约 1.1 points，符合污染比例增加的预期。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"60% 污染的 uniform PPL 显著高于 40%，为 reweighting 方法提供更大改善空间。\"\n\n  - name: \"ρ=0.6 Adaptive b* (seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_contamination_60_adaptive\"\n    description: \"60% 污染下的 dual-constraint adaptive\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 18.55\n      delta_vs_uniform: -0.25\n      b_star_mean: 0.85\n    result_rationale: >\n      ρ=0.6 时 detector 面对更多 synthetic 样本，q-score 分布右移，α_eff 约束更频繁 binding。\n      在 worst 档下，adaptive 在 ρ=0.6 的改善（-0.25）虽然绝对值看似比 ρ=0.4（-0.04）大，\n      但 relative improvement 仅 0.25/18.80=1.3%。更关键的是，rho06_delta_adaptive_vs_uniform \n      在 [0.01, 0.03] 的 normalized 范围内（占 uniform PPL 的比例）——效应未随污染率 scale up。\n      ρ=0.6 时 α_eff binding 比例更高（~55%），b* 被压得更低（mean 0.85 vs ρ=0.4 的 1.40），\n      更多 noisy borderline 样本被保留。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      ρ=0.6 的 adaptive PPL 在 worst 档预测范围 [18.4, 19.0] 内。\n      改善相对于 uniform 有限，α_eff 约束在高污染下更紧，性能受限。\n\n  - name: \"ρ=0.6 Grid-b=0.5 (seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_contamination_60_grid_b0_5\"\n    description: \"60% 污染下的 fixed b=0.5\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 18.50\n      delta_vs_uniform: -0.30\n    result_rationale: >\n      Fixed b=0.5 在 ρ=0.6 下仍然有效（甚至可能比 adaptive 更好），因为 b=0.5 的固定轻度 \n      downweighting 不受 α_eff 约束的干扰。在 ρ=0.6 下 grid-best 可能不再是 b=0.5 \n      而是略高的 b（如 b=1.0），但即使 b=0.5 也已优于 adaptive，因为 adaptive 的 b*_mean \n      被 α_eff 压到 0.85——低于 grid 的 optimal range。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"ρ=0.6 comparison (seed42)\"\n        headers: [\"Method\", \"eval_ppl\", \"Δ vs uniform\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Uniform\", 18.80, \"—\"]\n          - [\"Grid b=0.5\", 18.50, -0.30]\n          - [\"Dual adaptive\", 18.55, -0.25]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"ρ=0.4 vs ρ=0.6 效应量对比柱状图：adaptive 改善未随污染率 scale\"\n    analysis: >\n      ρ=0.6 时 adaptive 的改善不仅未放大，反而 underperform grid-b=0.5。α_eff 约束在高污染下 \n      更频繁 binding，将 b* 压到 suboptimal 低值。效应未 scale 是 worst 档的关键标志——\n      如果方法在更需要干预时反而干预不足，说明 α_eff 框架的方向性错误。\n\n  - name: \"n_min=4 ablation (seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_nmin_4\"\n    description: \"n_min=batch_size=4，ESS 约束强制 b*=0\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.690\n      b_star_mean: 0.00\n      pct_b_zero: 100\n    result_rationale: >\n      n_min=4=batch_size 时，ESS(b)≥4 要求所有样本权重完全相等（即 b=0）。任何 b>0 都会 \n      降低至少一个样本的权重，使 ESS<4。因此 b*=0 for all batches，等价于 uniform。\n      PPL=17.690 完全匹配 uniform baseline。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"符合理论预期的退化情况，验证 ESS 约束的边界行为。\"\n\n  - name: \"n_min=5 ablation (seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_nmin_5\"\n    description: \"n_min>batch_size，不可能满足 ESS 约束\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.690\n      b_star_mean: 0.00\n      pct_b_zero: 100\n    result_rationale: >\n      n_min=5 > batch_size=4，ESS 上界为 batch_size=4，永远无法满足 ESS≥5。\n      fallback 行为取决于实现（应该默认 b*=0），等价于 uniform。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"退化情况，与 n_min=4 相同。验证实现的 graceful degradation。\"\n\n  - name: \"batch_size=8 + grad_accum=2 (seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_batchsize_8\"\n    description: \"增大 micro-batch 到 8，保持 effective batch 不变\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.648\n      b_star_mean: 1.85\n      ess_mean: 3.80\n      pct_alpha_binding: 35\n      pct_ess_binding: 28\n      pct_b_zero: 37\n    result_rationale: >\n      batch_size=8 时 ESS 范围扩大到 [0,8]，n_min=2 的约束相对更宽松（25% vs 50% of batch_size）。\n      b* 分布有更多空间，α_eff binding 比例略降。在 worst 档下，larger batch 略有改善 \n      是因为 per-batch q-score 分布更稳定（更多样本 → 更准确的 α_eff 和 ESS 估计），\n      但改善有限（17.648 vs 17.650），因为根本问题（α_eff 约束方向性错误）未解决。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      batch_size 增大使 n_min=2 的 knife-edge 问题缓解，但 dual-constraint 的 α_eff 问题持续。\n      改善微弱，不足以 save the method。\n\n  - name: \"batch_size=16 + grad_accum=1 (seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_batchsize_16\"\n    description: \"micro-batch=16，保持 effective batch 不变\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.646\n      b_star_mean: 2.10\n      ess_mean: 6.50\n      pct_alpha_binding: 30\n    result_rationale: >\n      batch_size=16 进一步扩大 ESS 空间，b* 有更多调节余地。α_eff binding 比例降到 30%\n      （因为 larger batch 的 q-score 分布更集中，α_eff 更容易达到 τ）。PPL 17.646 稍优于 \n      batch_size=4 的 17.650，但仍不如 ESS-only（17.635）。即使 batch_size 增大让 dual \n      表现略好，ESS-only 在所有 batch_size 下都应该更优（因为问题在 α_eff 约束本身，\n      不在 batch_size）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"batch_size sensitivity (dual adaptive, seed42)\"\n        headers: [\"batch_size\", \"eval_ppl\", \"b*_mean\", \"pct_α_binding\"]\n        rows:\n          - [4, 17.650, 1.40, \"40%\"]\n          - [8, 17.648, 1.85, \"35%\"]\n          - [16, 17.646, 2.10, \"30%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"batch_size vs eval_ppl：微弱改善趋势，远不如切换到 ESS-only 的收益\"\n    analysis: \"增大 batch_size 缓解但不解决 α_eff 的根本问题。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P1 实验\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"ModernBERT detector (AUC≈0.99)\"\n    plan_id: \"p1_detector_modernbert\"\n    description: \"训练 ModernBERT 强检测器\"\n    expected_results:\n      auc: 0.986\n      ece_calibrated: 0.025\n    result_rationale: >\n      ModernBERT 150M 参数远超 TF-IDF+LR，AUC 应达到 ~0.986（对齐 Drayson 的报告）。\n      更好的 calibration（ECE=0.025）意味着 q-score 更准确。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"强检测器就绪，用于后续 detector ablation。\"\n\n  - name: \"Training with ModernBERT scores (seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p1_detector_ablation_training\"\n    description: \"使用强检测器分数的 adaptive 训练\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_adaptive_modernbert: 17.640\n      eval_ppl_ess_only_modernbert: 17.638\n      delta_dual_vs_ess_with_strong_detector: -0.002\n    result_rationale: >\n      更好的 detector（AUC=0.986 vs 0.939）减少 borderline 区域的 noise，α_eff 保留的 \n      borderline 样本质量更高。在 worst 档下，dual 和 ESS-only 的差距从 0.015 缩小到 0.002\n      （几乎消失），说明 α_eff 的 \"有害性\" 主要源于 detector noise——当 detector 足够好时，\n      α_eff 约束变得无害但也无益（因为 borderline 样本确实是 real 的）。这强化了 worst 档的 \n      narrative：α_eff 的价值完全取决于 detector quality，在 lightweight detector 下有害，\n      在强 detector 下无效——都不是 \"有益\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Detector quality × method interaction\"\n        headers: [\"Detector\", \"AUC\", \"Dual PPL\", \"ESS-only PPL\", \"Δ(dual-ESS)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"TF-IDF+LR\", 0.939, 17.650, 17.635, +0.015]\n          - [\"ModernBERT\", 0.986, 17.640, 17.638, +0.002]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Detector AUC vs dual/ESS-only gap：gap 随 AUC 缩小，说明 α_eff 的有害性源于 detector noise\"\n    analysis: >\n      关键 insight：α_eff 约束在 noisy detector 下有害（保留 noisy borderline），在强 detector \n      下无效（borderline 确实是 real，保留与否差异极小）。α_eff 从未 \"有益\"——这是 worst 档的 \n      最强 negative finding。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-generator data + training\"\n    plan_id: \"p1_cross_generator_training\"\n    description: \"Llama-3.2-1B 生成 synthetic，Qwen3-0.6B 训练\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_adaptive: 17.680\n      eval_ppl_uniform: 17.720\n      delta: -0.040\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cross-generator 场景下 detector 面对不同分布的 synthetic 数据，AUC 可能下降。\n      在 worst 档下，adaptive 仍有微弱改善（-0.04），但不强于 self-generated 设置，\n      说明方法至少不崩溃但也不 scale to harder settings。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"方法在 cross-generator 下不崩溃，但改善有限。\"\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.2-3B adaptive + uniform (seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p1_llama3b_adaptive\"\n    description: \"3B 模型上的 adaptive 验证\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_uniform: 12.50\n      eval_ppl_adaptive: 12.48\n      delta: -0.02\n    result_rationale: >\n      3B 模型更强，对 contamination 的 robustness 更高，reweighting 效应被自然压缩。\n      在 worst 档下，adaptive 改善仅 0.02 PPL（relative <0.2%），在更大模型上效应更弱。\n      这支持 \"效应量小\" 的 reviewer concern。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"3B 模型上效应进一步缩小，worst 档预期。\"\n\n  - name: \"Detect-and-remove baseline (seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p1_baseline_detect_remove\"\n    description: \"Hard threshold q>0.5 直接移除，不做 soft reweighting\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.670\n      effective_tokens: 128000000\n      pct_removed: 36\n    result_rationale: >\n      Hard removal 移除约 36% 的数据（ρ=0.4 中 q>0.5 的样本），token 数减少。\n      PPL=17.670 在 uniform(17.690) 和 grid-best(17.651) 之间。在 worst 档下，\n      detect-and-remove 不比 ESS-only adaptive 好（17.670 vs 17.635），但展示了 \n      hard filtering 作为 simple baseline 的合理性。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Soft reweighting 优于 hard removal，但差距不大。\"\n\n  - name: \"Random reweighting baseline (seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p1_baseline_random_reweight\"\n    description: \"随机权重（与 q-score 无关），验证 detector signal 的 load-bearing 性\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.710\n      delta_vs_uniform: +0.020\n    result_rationale: >\n      随机权重引入不相关的梯度噪声，应该比 uniform 更差。PPL 17.710 略高于 uniform 17.690，\n      确认 detector signal 是有用的（非随机权重的效果不是来自噪声注入）。但差距只有 0.02，\n      说明即使随机加权也不会造成灾难性恶化——整体方法的效应量确实不大。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"随机权重比 uniform 差，确认 detector signal load-bearing。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P2 实验\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Domain-skewed injection (seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p2_domain_skewed\"\n    description: \"Code-heavy 合成数据污染，非均匀域分布\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_adaptive: 17.68\n      eval_ppl_uniform: 17.75\n      delta: -0.07\n    result_rationale: >\n      Domain-skewed 污染更 realistic，detector 在 code domain 可能 AUC 不同。\n      Adaptive 改善略大于 uniform injection（-0.07 vs -0.04），因为 domain-skewed \n      batch 内 q-score 分布更极端（有些 batch 几乎全是 code synthetic），\n      per-batch adaptive 能更好适应。但在 worst 档下，ESS-only 仍应优于 dual。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Domain-skewed 下 adaptive 的相对优势略增，但不改变 worst 档结论。\"\n\n  - name: \"Downstream eval (MMLU/HellaSwag)\"\n    plan_id: \"p2_downstream_eval\"\n    description: \"Llama-3.2-3B checkpoints 的下游任务评估\"\n    expected_results:\n      mmlu_uniform: 25.2\n      mmlu_adaptive: 25.3\n      hellaswag_uniform: 38.5\n      hellaswag_adaptive: 38.6\n    result_rationale: >\n      PPL 差异 0.02 在下游任务上几乎不可分辨。MMLU 和 HellaSwag 的改善在噪声范围内\n      （±0.5 point），无法声称 downstream 改善。在 worst 档下，PPL 的微弱差异 \n      不传导到 downstream metrics。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"下游任务改善不显著，与 worst 档 PPL 效应量一致。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # 综合分析\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Aggregate analysis — worst tier\"\n    plan_id: \"aggregate\"\n    description: \"全实验综合分析与 narrative pivot\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_dual_seed42: 17.650\n      eval_ppl_ess_only_seed42: 17.635\n      delta_dual_vs_ess_only: -0.015\n      tau_sweep_ppl_range: 0.040\n      tau_sweep_ppl_std: 0.015\n      eval_ppl_golden_ratio_seed42: 17.625\n      eval_ppl_nmin1_seed42: 17.632\n      rho06_delta_adaptive_vs_uniform: 0.013\n      rho06_adaptive_ppl: 18.55\n      mvp_ratio_aggregate: 68\n    result_rationale: >\n      所有指标落在 worst 档定义的关键指标范围内：\n      - dual PPL 17.650 ∈ [17.64, 17.66] ✓\n      - ESS-only PPL 17.635 ∈ [17.62, 17.64] ✓  \n      - delta -0.015 ∈ [-0.04, -0.01] ✓ (ESS-only 更优)\n      - τ sweep range 0.040 → std ≈ 0.015，无 plateau ✓\n      - Golden Ratio 17.625 ∈ [17.60, 17.64] ✓\n      - n_min=1 17.632 ∈ [17.62, 17.65] ✓\n      - ρ=0.6 Δ adaptive 0.013 ∈ [0.01, 0.03] ✓\n      - ρ=0.6 adaptive PPL 18.55 ∈ [18.4, 19.0] ✓\n      - MVP ratio (recalculated with ESS-only as reference) ~68 ∈ [50, 75] ✓\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Complete methods ranking (seed42, ρ=0.4)\"\n        headers: [\"Rank\", \"Method\", \"eval_ppl\", \"Δ vs uniform\", \"需额外成本\"]\n        rows:\n          - [1, \"Golden Ratio oracle\", 17.625, -0.065, \"已知比例\"]\n          - [2, \"n_min=1 (quasi-unconstrained)\", 17.632, -0.058, \"无\"]\n          - [3, \"ESS-only adaptive\", 17.635, -0.055, \"无\"]\n          - [4, \"Dual adaptive (τ=0.5)\", 17.640, -0.050, \"无\"]\n          - [5, \"batch_size=16 dual\", 17.646, -0.044, \"无\"]\n          - [6, \"batch_size=8 dual\", 17.648, -0.042, \"无\"]\n          - [7, \"Dual adaptive (τ=0.8, default)\", 17.650, -0.040, \"无\"]\n          - [8, \"Grid-best (b=0.5)\", 17.651, -0.039, \"Grid search\"]\n          - [9, \"Dual adaptive (τ=0.9)\", 17.680, -0.010, \"无\"]\n          - [10, \"Detect-and-remove\", 17.670, -0.020, \"无\"]\n          - [11, \"Uniform\", 17.690, \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [12, \"Random reweight\", 17.710, +0.020, \"无\"]\n      - name: \"Claim status under worst tier\"\n        headers: [\"Claim\", \"Original status\", \"Worst-tier status\", \"Action\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Claim 1 (dual-constraint)\", \"Core\", \"FAILED — α_eff harmful\", \"Pivot: ESS-only as main method, dual as negative finding\"]\n          - [\"Claim 2 (免调参)\", \"PASS (88.6%)\", \"WEAKENED (~68%)\", \"Reframe: ESS-only 也免调参且更优\"]\n          - [\"Claim 3 (unknown proportion)\", \"Pending τ sweep\", \"CHALLENGED — τ sensitive\", \"τ sweep 作为 negative evidence\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 1: α_eff(b) 和 ESS(b) 双轴图 → 保留，但 reframe 为 'why min-intervention fails'\"\n      - \"Figure 2: Methods ranking waterfall chart — Golden Ratio > ESS-only > Dual > Grid > Uniform\"\n      - \"Figure 3: τ sensitivity — PPL 单调递增，无 plateau，annotation: 'α_eff constraint is uniformly harmful'\"\n      - \"Figure 4: Detector quality × method interaction — α_eff 在 weak detector 下有害，strong detector 下无效\"\n      - \"Figure 5: ρ=0.4 vs ρ=0.6 效应量对比 — effect does not scale with contamination\"\n    analysis: >\n      Worst 档的核心叙事：\n\n      1. **ESS-only adaptive b* 是简单有效的主方法**——per-batch 自适应消除 grid search，\n         PPL 17.635 优于 grid-best 17.651，且无需任何超参（n_min 只需设一个宽松值如 2）。\n      \n      2. **α_eff 质量下界约束是 negative finding**——min-intervention 不优于 max-intervention。\n         根本原因：在 detector calibration 不完美时（AUC=0.939），q-score 的噪声使得 \n         α_eff 阈值化保留的 \"borderline\" 样本实际质量可疑。α_eff 的保守干预保留了过多 \n         noisy samples，反而有害。\n      \n      3. **τ 高度敏感**——PPL 随 τ 单调递增，无 plateau region，最优方向是消除 α_eff 约束。\n         这使得 τ 不是 \"insensitive default\"，而是需要仔细调节的超参——而最优调节结果 \n         等价于不用 α_eff。\n      \n      4. **论文 reframe 为 empirical study of adaptive importance weighting**：\n         - Contribution 1: ESS-only adaptive b* 消除 grid search\n         - Contribution 2: α_eff negative finding + detector quality interaction analysis\n         - Contribution 3: Lightweight detector sufficiency (TF-IDF+LR 即可)\n         - Contribution 4: Loss reweighting vs SIR 的实证对比\n      \n      5. **仍可冲 EMNLP**：negative finding 本身有价值（explains when/why quality floor \n         constraints fail），ESS-only adaptive 是实用贡献。需补做 ESS-only × 3 seeds \n         + ρ=0.6 ESS-only 来支撑新主方法。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":22799,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":22799},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d5f8633e-2816-4397-b5fc-79fcaadc8881","uuid":"ffe45132-7153-49c6-8b05-8178a302309a"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":225802,"duration_api_ms":227176,"num_turns":1,"result":"Looking at the experiment plan and the worst-tier definition, I'll construct the detailed imagined data.\n\n```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  α_eff 约束有害——保留了 detector 误判的 borderline 样本，ESS-only 的 max-intervention 反而更优。\n  论文 pivot 为 empirical study：ESS-only adaptive b* 为主方法，α_eff 质量下界作为 negative finding，\n  τ sensitivity 作为 negative evidence。Claim 2 保留（ESS-only 也免调参），Claim 3 弱化。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  # ============================================================\n  # 已完成实验（锚定真实数据）\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Uniform baselines × 3 seeds\"\n    plan_id: \"mvp_uniform\"\n    description: \"ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, 200M tokens, 3 seeds uniform training\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_seed42: 17.690\n      eval_ppl_seed123: 17.690\n      eval_ppl_seed456: 17.700\n      seed_variance: 0.005\n    result_rationale: \"真实数据，已完成。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Uniform baseline 建立。三 seed PPL 极度一致（std=0.005），说明 seed variance 很小，后续实验间 0.01 级差异即有意义。\"\n\n  - name: \"Grid-b sweep seed42 (b=0.5/1.0/1.5/2.0/3.0/5.0)\"\n    plan_id: \"mvp_grid_b_seed42\"\n    description: \"固定 b 值 grid search，seed42\"\n    expected_results:\n      b0_5_eval_ppl: 17.651\n      b1_0_eval_ppl: 17.692\n      b1_5_eval_ppl: 17.718\n      b2_0_eval_ppl: 17.741\n      b3_0_eval_ppl: 17.774\n      b5_0_eval_ppl: 17.818\n      best_b: 0.5\n    result_rationale: \"真实数据，已完成。b=0.5 最优，PPL 随 b 单调递增。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Grid-best 在 b=0.5，说明轻度 downweighting 最优。b 越大 PPL 越差——过度 downweighting 丢失有效信息。\"\n\n  - name: \"Adaptive_fix × 3 seeds (n_min=2, τ=0.8)\"\n    plan_id: \"mvp_adaptive_fix\"\n    description: \"Dual-constraint adaptive b*, 3 seeds\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_seed42: 17.650\n      eval_ppl_seed123: 17.643\n      eval_ppl_seed456: 17.660\n      b_star_mean: 1.40\n      mvp_ratio_aggregate: 88.6\n    result_rationale: \"真实数据，已完成。Adaptive 在 seed42/456 接近 grid-best，seed123 稍逊于 grid-best(17.638)。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Claim 2 通过 Path B。但 adaptive b* mean=1.4 远高于 grid-best b=0.5，说明 adaptive 倾向于 under-downweight（α_eff binding 时 b* 仅 1.67）。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # RUNNING / PLANNED 实验——worst 档预测\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"ESS-only adaptive baseline (seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_ess_only_baseline\"\n    description: \"max{b : ESS≥n_min}，无 α_eff 约束，seed42\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.635\n      b_star_mean: 4.15\n      b_star_median: 3.20\n      ess_mean: 2.05\n      pct_b_zero: 49.9\n      delta_vs_dual: -0.015\n    result_rationale: >\n      ESS-only 选择 max{b : ESS≥n_min}，在 α_eff binding 的 ~40% reweighted batches 中，\n      b* 从 dual 的 1.67 跳到 4.15（2.5×）。这意味着对 synthetic 样本施加更激进的 downweight。\n      在 worst 档下，detector AUC=0.939 的 q-score 噪声使得 α_eff 阈值化保留的 \"borderline\" \n      样本实际质量可疑——这些样本 q ∈ [0.3, 0.5]，detector 不确定它们是否 synthetic，但 α_eff \n      约束强制保留它们（因为 b* 被压低以满足 α_eff≥τ）。ESS-only 直接把这些可疑样本大幅降权，\n      反而避免了 noisy borderline 样本对梯度的干扰。PPL 17.635 优于 dual 的 17.650，差值 0.015 \n      超过 seed variance（~0.005），形成统计可辨别的差异。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"ESS-only vs Dual head-to-head (seed42)\"\n        headers: [\"Method\", \"eval_ppl\", \"b*_mean\", \"ESS_mean\", \"Δ vs uniform\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Uniform\", 17.690, \"—\", \"—\", \"0.000\"]\n          - [\"Grid-best (b=0.5)\", 17.651, 0.5, \"—\", \"-0.039\"]\n          - [\"Dual (α_eff+ESS)\", 17.650, 1.40, 2.60, \"-0.040\"]\n          - [\"ESS-only\", 17.635, 4.15, 2.05, \"-0.055\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"b* 分布对比直方图：dual 集中在 [0.5, 2.0]，ESS-only 呈双峰分布（b*=0 和 b*∈[3,6]），说明 ESS-only 对 contaminated batch 施加更激进干预\"\n    analysis: >\n      ESS-only 明确优于 dual，差值 0.015 约为 seed variance 的 3 倍。核心原因：AUC=0.939 的 detector \n      在 borderline 区域（q ∈ [0.3, 0.5]）有大量误判，α_eff 约束迫使 b* 降低以保留这些样本的有效权重，\n      但这些样本中相当一部分实际是 synthetic。ESS-only 的 max-intervention 策略绕过了这个问题——\n      直接最大化 downweight 力度到 ESS 允许的极限。min-intervention principle 在 detector \n      calibration 不完美时适得其反。\n\n  - name: \"τ sweep (τ=0.5/0.6/0.7/0.8/0.9)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_tau_sweep\"\n    description: \"τ sensitivity 分析，seed42，ρ=0.4\"\n    expected_results:\n      tau_05_eval_ppl: 17.640\n      tau_06_eval_ppl: 17.644\n      tau_07_eval_ppl: 17.648\n      tau_08_eval_ppl: 17.650\n      tau_09_eval_ppl: 17.680\n      ppl_range: 0.040\n      ppl_std: 0.015\n      tau_095_eval_ppl: 17.800\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 worst 档下，τ sweep 暴露高度敏感性。τ 越低，α_eff 约束越宽松，b* 越大（趋近 ESS-only），\n      PPL 越好——这直接说明 α_eff 约束是有害的，放松它反而改善性能。τ=0.5 接近 ESS-only 效果\n      （α_eff 约束几乎不 binding），PPL 17.640 接近 ESS-only 的 17.635。τ=0.9 时约束过紧，\n      大量 batch 的 b* 被压到很低值，大量 noisy 样本被保留，PPL 恶化到 17.680。\n      τ=0.95 极端情况下几乎所有 batch 都被 α_eff 约束主导，b* 接近 0，PPL 退化到 17.800。\n      PPL 随 τ 单调递增（无 plateau），range=0.040 >> seed variance（0.005），std=0.015 >> \n      pass criteria 的 0.05 threshold。无 robust region——τ 选择直接决定性能，违背 Claim 3 的\n      \"any reasonable τ works\" 论断。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"τ sweep results (seed42, ρ=0.4)\"\n        headers: [\"τ\", \"eval_ppl\", \"Δ vs τ=0.8\", \"pct α_eff binding\", \"b*_mean\"]\n        rows:\n          - [0.50, 17.640, -0.010, \"5%\", 3.80]\n          - [0.60, 17.644, -0.006, \"12%\", 3.20]\n          - [0.70, 17.648, -0.002, \"25%\", 2.30]\n          - [0.80, 17.650, \"0.000 (ref)\", \"40%\", 1.40]\n          - [0.90, 17.680, +0.030, \"68%\", 0.65]\n          - [0.95, 17.800, +0.150, \"89%\", 0.15]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"τ vs eval_ppl 折线图：单调递增，无 plateau，低 τ 趋近 ESS-only 性能\"\n      - \"τ vs pct_alpha_binding 柱状图：从 5%(τ=0.5) 到 89%(τ=0.95)，α_eff 约束从几乎无到完全主导\"\n    analysis: >\n      τ sweep 是 worst 档的核心证据。PPL 随 τ 单调递增、无 plateau，说明 α_eff 约束越紧性能越差。\n      最优 τ 是尽量低（约束不 binding），等价于放弃 α_eff 约束。这从根本上削弱了 dual-constraint \n      框架——如果最优策略是让 α_eff 不 binding，那 α_eff 就不应该存在于方法中。\n      Claim 3 受到严重挑战：τ 不是 \"insensitive hyperparameter\"，而是决定方法质量的关键参数，\n      且最优方向是消除 α_eff 约束本身。\n\n  - name: \"Golden Ratio oracle baseline (seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_golden_ratio_baseline\"\n    description: \"w=1/φ≈0.618 for synthetic, 1.0 for real，已知比例 oracle\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.625\n      delta_vs_adaptive: -0.025\n      delta_vs_ess_only: -0.010\n      delta_vs_uniform: -0.065\n    result_rationale: >\n      Golden Ratio 使用已知比例 k 推导理论最优权重 w*=1/φ，且直接使用 ground truth label \n      区分 real/synthetic（不依赖 noisy detector）。在 worst 档下，它明确优于 adaptive（差值 0.025）\n      和 ESS-only（差值 0.010）。这说明：(1) 已知比例确实 matters——Claim 3 \"unknown proportion\" \n      的 setting 虽然实际重要，但确实牺牲了性能；(2) detector noise 是 adaptive 方法的瓶颈——\n      即使 ESS-only 绕过了 α_eff 的 borderline 保留问题，detector 的 q-score 误差仍然限制了\n      reweighting 质量；(3) adaptive（dual 或 ESS-only）与 oracle 的差距 0.01-0.025 虽不大，\n      但在 seed variance=0.005 的背景下是可辨别的。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"All methods comparison (seed42, ρ=0.4)\"\n        headers: [\"Method\", \"eval_ppl\", \"Δ vs uniform\", \"需要已知比例?\", \"需要 validation?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Uniform\", 17.690, \"—\", \"No\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"Grid-best (b=0.5)\", 17.651, -0.039, \"No\", \"Yes (grid search)\"]\n          - [\"Dual adaptive (τ=0.8)\", 17.650, -0.040, \"No\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"ESS-only adaptive\", 17.635, -0.055, \"No\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"Golden Ratio oracle\", 17.625, -0.065, \"Yes\", \"No\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Methods ranking bar chart：Golden Ratio > ESS-only > Grid-best ≈ Dual > Uniform\"\n    analysis: >\n      Golden Ratio oracle 明确优于所有 adaptive 方法，gap 可辨别。Claim 3 核心未被否定\n      （方法确实不需要已知比例即可运行），但 negative finding 是 proportion knowledge \n      确实提供性能优势。论文需诚实讨论这个 trade-off。\n\n  - name: \"n_min=1 ablation (seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_nmin_1\"\n    description: \"ESS 约束极度宽松（n_min=1），几乎无 ESS 约束\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.632\n      b_star_mean: 6.80\n      b_star_median: 5.20\n      ess_mean: 1.30\n      pct_ess_binding: 15\n      pct_alpha_binding: 60\n    result_rationale: >\n      n_min=1 使 ESS 约束极度宽松（batch_size=4 时 ESS≥1 几乎总能满足），b* 主要由 α_eff \n      约束决定。在 worst 档下，n_min=1 反而更优（17.632 vs dual n_min=2 的 17.650），\n      因为更宽松的 ESS 约束允许更激进的 downweighting。这与 ESS-only 的 finding 一致——\n      更多 downweighting = 更好。n_min=1 甚至接近 ESS-only（17.635），因为虽然 α_eff 仍 binding，\n      但 ESS 约束几乎不起作用，b* 能达到更高值。这个结果直接矛盾 dual-constraint 的 \"保守干预\" \n      逻辑——ESS 约束应该提供\"稳定上界\"防止 over-downweight，但放松它反而更好。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"n_min sensitivity (seed42, ρ=0.4)\"\n        headers: [\"n_min\", \"eval_ppl\", \"b*_mean\", \"ESS_mean\", \"行为\"]\n        rows:\n          - [1, 17.632, 6.80, 1.30, \"几乎无 ESS 约束，接近 max-b\"]\n          - [2, 17.650, 1.40, 2.60, \"Dual default，α_eff binding 40%\"]\n          - [3, 17.690, 0.30, 3.50, \"ESS 过紧，b* 被钳制，≈uniform\"]\n          - [\"ESS-only(n_min=2)\", 17.635, 4.15, 2.05, \"无 α_eff，max intervention\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"n_min vs eval_ppl 折线图：单调递增——n_min 越小（约束越松、b*越大）PPL 越好\"\n    analysis: >\n      n_min=1 优于 n_min=2，说明 ESS 约束也是有害的（在当前 batch_size=4 的设置下）。\n      更宽松约束 → 更大 b* → 更多 downweight → 更好 PPL。这与 dual-constraint 的 min-intervention \n      原则根本矛盾。论文需 pivot：ESS 约束的 n_min 不应追求 \"适度保守\"，而应尽量宽松。\n\n  - name: \"Grid-b low (b=0.1/0.2/0.3) × 3 seeds\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_grid_b_low_seed42\"\n    description: \"探索 b<0.5 区域是否有更优 grid-best\"\n    expected_results:\n      b0_1_eval_ppl_seed42: 17.680\n      b0_2_eval_ppl_seed42: 17.668\n      b0_3_eval_ppl_seed42: 17.658\n      b0_1_eval_ppl_seed123: 17.675\n      b0_2_eval_ppl_seed123: 17.660\n      b0_3_eval_ppl_seed123: 17.648\n      b0_1_eval_ppl_seed456: 17.685\n      b0_2_eval_ppl_seed456: 17.672\n      b0_3_eval_ppl_seed456: 17.660\n    result_rationale: >\n      b<0.5 区域应延续 grid sweep 的单调趋势：b 越小 PPL 越接近 uniform。b=0.3 约在 b=0.5(17.651) \n      和 uniform(17.690) 之间。b=0.5 仍是 grid-best，但 b=0.3 差距不大。\n      在 worst 档下这个实验的意义是：grid-best b=0.5 得到确认，adaptive b*_mean=1.40 远高于 \n      grid-best 0.5，但 ESS-only b*_mean=4.15 也远高于 grid-best 却表现更好——说明 batch-adaptive \n      的动态 b* 与 fixed b 的效果不能简单通过 mean b* 比较，per-batch 自适应本身有价值。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Extended grid-b curve (seed42)\"\n        headers: [\"b\", \"eval_ppl\", \"Δ vs uniform\"]\n        rows:\n          - [0.0, 17.690, \"0.000 (uniform)\"]\n          - [0.1, 17.680, -0.010]\n          - [0.2, 17.668, -0.022]\n          - [0.3, 17.658, -0.032]\n          - [0.5, 17.651, -0.039]\n          - [1.0, 17.692, +0.002]\n          - [1.5, 17.718, +0.028]\n          - [2.0, 17.741, +0.051]\n          - [3.0, 17.774, +0.084]\n          - [5.0, 17.818, +0.128]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"完整 grid-b 曲线（b=0.1 到 5.0）：U 型但不对称，最优在 b=0.5，右侧陡峭上升\"\n    analysis: >\n      b=0.5 确认为 grid-best。b=0.3 也不差（-0.032 vs uniform），说明 b 在 [0.3, 0.5] 区间 \n      都有效。关键对比：fixed b=0.5 (PPL=17.651) vs ESS-only adaptive (PPL=17.635)——\n      per-batch 自适应带来额外 0.016 改善，证明 adaptive b* 的价值（不论 dual 还是 ESS-only）。\n\n  - name: \"ρ=0.6 数据生成\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_contamination_60_datagen\"\n    description: \"60% 污染率数据集\"\n    expected_results:\n      total_tokens: 200000000\n      contamination_ratio: 0.6\n      scored_data_ready: true\n    result_rationale: \"数据生成是确定性步骤，无需预测。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"数据准备就绪。\"\n\n  - name: \"ρ=0.6 Uniform baseline (seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_contamination_60_uniform\"\n    description: \"60% 污染下的 uniform baseline\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 18.80\n    result_rationale: >\n      60% 污染比 40% 多 50% 的 synthetic 数据。Uniform baseline PPL 从 17.69(ρ=0.4) \n      上升到约 18.80，因为更多低质量 synthetic 样本拉低了整体训练质量。\n      PPL 跳跃约 1.1 points，符合污染比例增加的预期。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"60% 污染的 uniform PPL 显著高于 40%，为 reweighting 方法提供更大改善空间。\"\n\n  - name: \"ρ=0.6 Adaptive b* (seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_contamination_60_adaptive\"\n    description: \"60% 污染下的 dual-constraint adaptive\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 18.55\n      delta_vs_uniform: -0.25\n      b_star_mean: 0.85\n    result_rationale: >\n      ρ=0.6 时 detector 面对更多 synthetic 样本，q-score 分布右移，α_eff 约束更频繁 binding。\n      在 worst 档下，adaptive 在 ρ=0.6 的改善（-0.25）虽然绝对值看似比 ρ=0.4（-0.04）大，\n      但 relative improvement 仅 0.25/18.80=1.3%。更关键的是，rho06_delta_adaptive_vs_uniform \n      在 [0.01, 0.03] 的 normalized 范围内（占 uniform PPL 的比例）——效应未随污染率 scale up。\n      ρ=0.6 时 α_eff binding 比例更高（~55%），b* 被压得更低（mean 0.85 vs ρ=0.4 的 1.40），\n      更多 noisy borderline 样本被保留。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      ρ=0.6 的 adaptive PPL 在 worst 档预测范围 [18.4, 19.0] 内。\n      改善相对于 uniform 有限，α_eff 约束在高污染下更紧，性能受限。\n\n  - name: \"ρ=0.6 Grid-b=0.5 (seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_contamination_60_grid_b0_5\"\n    description: \"60% 污染下的 fixed b=0.5\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 18.50\n      delta_vs_uniform: -0.30\n    result_rationale: >\n      Fixed b=0.5 在 ρ=0.6 下仍然有效（甚至可能比 adaptive 更好），因为 b=0.5 的固定轻度 \n      downweighting 不受 α_eff 约束的干扰。在 ρ=0.6 下 grid-best 可能不再是 b=0.5 \n      而是略高的 b（如 b=1.0），但即使 b=0.5 也已优于 adaptive，因为 adaptive 的 b*_mean \n      被 α_eff 压到 0.85——低于 grid 的 optimal range。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"ρ=0.6 comparison (seed42)\"\n        headers: [\"Method\", \"eval_ppl\", \"Δ vs uniform\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Uniform\", 18.80, \"—\"]\n          - [\"Grid b=0.5\", 18.50, -0.30]\n          - [\"Dual adaptive\", 18.55, -0.25]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"ρ=0.4 vs ρ=0.6 效应量对比柱状图：adaptive 改善未随污染率 scale\"\n    analysis: >\n      ρ=0.6 时 adaptive 的改善不仅未放大，反而 underperform grid-b=0.5。α_eff 约束在高污染下 \n      更频繁 binding，将 b* 压到 suboptimal 低值。效应未 scale 是 worst 档的关键标志——\n      如果方法在更需要干预时反而干预不足，说明 α_eff 框架的方向性错误。\n\n  - name: \"n_min=4 ablation (seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_nmin_4\"\n    description: \"n_min=batch_size=4，ESS 约束强制 b*=0\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.690\n      b_star_mean: 0.00\n      pct_b_zero: 100\n    result_rationale: >\n      n_min=4=batch_size 时，ESS(b)≥4 要求所有样本权重完全相等（即 b=0）。任何 b>0 都会 \n      降低至少一个样本的权重，使 ESS<4。因此 b*=0 for all batches，等价于 uniform。\n      PPL=17.690 完全匹配 uniform baseline。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"符合理论预期的退化情况，验证 ESS 约束的边界行为。\"\n\n  - name: \"n_min=5 ablation (seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_nmin_5\"\n    description: \"n_min>batch_size，不可能满足 ESS 约束\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.690\n      b_star_mean: 0.00\n      pct_b_zero: 100\n    result_rationale: >\n      n_min=5 > batch_size=4，ESS 上界为 batch_size=4，永远无法满足 ESS≥5。\n      fallback 行为取决于实现（应该默认 b*=0），等价于 uniform。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"退化情况，与 n_min=4 相同。验证实现的 graceful degradation。\"\n\n  - name: \"batch_size=8 + grad_accum=2 (seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_batchsize_8\"\n    description: \"增大 micro-batch 到 8，保持 effective batch 不变\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.648\n      b_star_mean: 1.85\n      ess_mean: 3.80\n      pct_alpha_binding: 35\n      pct_ess_binding: 28\n      pct_b_zero: 37\n    result_rationale: >\n      batch_size=8 时 ESS 范围扩大到 [0,8]，n_min=2 的约束相对更宽松（25% vs 50% of batch_size）。\n      b* 分布有更多空间，α_eff binding 比例略降。在 worst 档下，larger batch 略有改善 \n      是因为 per-batch q-score 分布更稳定（更多样本 → 更准确的 α_eff 和 ESS 估计），\n      但改善有限（17.648 vs 17.650），因为根本问题（α_eff 约束方向性错误）未解决。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      batch_size 增大使 n_min=2 的 knife-edge 问题缓解，但 dual-constraint 的 α_eff 问题持续。\n      改善微弱，不足以 save the method。\n\n  - name: \"batch_size=16 + grad_accum=1 (seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p0_batchsize_16\"\n    description: \"micro-batch=16，保持 effective batch 不变\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.646\n      b_star_mean: 2.10\n      ess_mean: 6.50\n      pct_alpha_binding: 30\n    result_rationale: >\n      batch_size=16 进一步扩大 ESS 空间，b* 有更多调节余地。α_eff binding 比例降到 30%\n      （因为 larger batch 的 q-score 分布更集中，α_eff 更容易达到 τ）。PPL 17.646 稍优于 \n      batch_size=4 的 17.650，但仍不如 ESS-only（17.635）。即使 batch_size 增大让 dual \n      表现略好，ESS-only 在所有 batch_size 下都应该更优（因为问题在 α_eff 约束本身，\n      不在 batch_size）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"batch_size sensitivity (dual adaptive, seed42)\"\n        headers: [\"batch_size\", \"eval_ppl\", \"b*_mean\", \"pct_α_binding\"]\n        rows:\n          - [4, 17.650, 1.40, \"40%\"]\n          - [8, 17.648, 1.85, \"35%\"]\n          - [16, 17.646, 2.10, \"30%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"batch_size vs eval_ppl：微弱改善趋势，远不如切换到 ESS-only 的收益\"\n    analysis: \"增大 batch_size 缓解但不解决 α_eff 的根本问题。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P1 实验\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"ModernBERT detector (AUC≈0.99)\"\n    plan_id: \"p1_detector_modernbert\"\n    description: \"训练 ModernBERT 强检测器\"\n    expected_results:\n      auc: 0.986\n      ece_calibrated: 0.025\n    result_rationale: >\n      ModernBERT 150M 参数远超 TF-IDF+LR，AUC 应达到 ~0.986（对齐 Drayson 的报告）。\n      更好的 calibration（ECE=0.025）意味着 q-score 更准确。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"强检测器就绪，用于后续 detector ablation。\"\n\n  - name: \"Training with ModernBERT scores (seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p1_detector_ablation_training\"\n    description: \"使用强检测器分数的 adaptive 训练\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_adaptive_modernbert: 17.640\n      eval_ppl_ess_only_modernbert: 17.638\n      delta_dual_vs_ess_with_strong_detector: -0.002\n    result_rationale: >\n      更好的 detector（AUC=0.986 vs 0.939）减少 borderline 区域的 noise，α_eff 保留的 \n      borderline 样本质量更高。在 worst 档下，dual 和 ESS-only 的差距从 0.015 缩小到 0.002\n      （几乎消失），说明 α_eff 的 \"有害性\" 主要源于 detector noise——当 detector 足够好时，\n      α_eff 约束变得无害但也无益（因为 borderline 样本确实是 real 的）。这强化了 worst 档的 \n      narrative：α_eff 的价值完全取决于 detector quality，在 lightweight detector 下有害，\n      在强 detector 下无效——都不是 \"有益\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Detector quality × method interaction\"\n        headers: [\"Detector\", \"AUC\", \"Dual PPL\", \"ESS-only PPL\", \"Δ(dual-ESS)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"TF-IDF+LR\", 0.939, 17.650, 17.635, +0.015]\n          - [\"ModernBERT\", 0.986, 17.640, 17.638, +0.002]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Detector AUC vs dual/ESS-only gap：gap 随 AUC 缩小，说明 α_eff 的有害性源于 detector noise\"\n    analysis: >\n      关键 insight：α_eff 约束在 noisy detector 下有害（保留 noisy borderline），在强 detector \n      下无效（borderline 确实是 real，保留与否差异极小）。α_eff 从未 \"有益\"——这是 worst 档的 \n      最强 negative finding。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-generator data + training\"\n    plan_id: \"p1_cross_generator_training\"\n    description: \"Llama-3.2-1B 生成 synthetic，Qwen3-0.6B 训练\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_adaptive: 17.680\n      eval_ppl_uniform: 17.720\n      delta: -0.040\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cross-generator 场景下 detector 面对不同分布的 synthetic 数据，AUC 可能下降。\n      在 worst 档下，adaptive 仍有微弱改善（-0.04），但不强于 self-generated 设置，\n      说明方法至少不崩溃但也不 scale to harder settings。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"方法在 cross-generator 下不崩溃，但改善有限。\"\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.2-3B adaptive + uniform (seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p1_llama3b_adaptive\"\n    description: \"3B 模型上的 adaptive 验证\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_uniform: 12.50\n      eval_ppl_adaptive: 12.48\n      delta: -0.02\n    result_rationale: >\n      3B 模型更强，对 contamination 的 robustness 更高，reweighting 效应被自然压缩。\n      在 worst 档下，adaptive 改善仅 0.02 PPL（relative <0.2%），在更大模型上效应更弱。\n      这支持 \"效应量小\" 的 reviewer concern。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"3B 模型上效应进一步缩小，worst 档预期。\"\n\n  - name: \"Detect-and-remove baseline (seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p1_baseline_detect_remove\"\n    description: \"Hard threshold q>0.5 直接移除，不做 soft reweighting\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.670\n      effective_tokens: 128000000\n      pct_removed: 36\n    result_rationale: >\n      Hard removal 移除约 36% 的数据（ρ=0.4 中 q>0.5 的样本），token 数减少。\n      PPL=17.670 在 uniform(17.690) 和 grid-best(17.651) 之间。在 worst 档下，\n      detect-and-remove 不比 ESS-only adaptive 好（17.670 vs 17.635），但展示了 \n      hard filtering 作为 simple baseline 的合理性。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Soft reweighting 优于 hard removal，但差距不大。\"\n\n  - name: \"Random reweighting baseline (seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p1_baseline_random_reweight\"\n    description: \"随机权重（与 q-score 无关），验证 detector signal 的 load-bearing 性\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.710\n      delta_vs_uniform: +0.020\n    result_rationale: >\n      随机权重引入不相关的梯度噪声，应该比 uniform 更差。PPL 17.710 略高于 uniform 17.690，\n      确认 detector signal 是有用的（非随机权重的效果不是来自噪声注入）。但差距只有 0.02，\n      说明即使随机加权也不会造成灾难性恶化——整体方法的效应量确实不大。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"随机权重比 uniform 差，确认 detector signal load-bearing。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P2 实验\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Domain-skewed injection (seed42)\"\n    plan_id: \"p2_domain_skewed\"\n    description: \"Code-heavy 合成数据污染，非均匀域分布\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_adaptive: 17.68\n      eval_ppl_uniform: 17.75\n      delta: -0.07\n    result_rationale: >\n      Domain-skewed 污染更 realistic，detector 在 code domain 可能 AUC 不同。\n      Adaptive 改善略大于 uniform injection（-0.07 vs -0.04），因为 domain-skewed \n      batch 内 q-score 分布更极端（有些 batch 几乎全是 code synthetic），\n      per-batch adaptive 能更好适应。但在 worst 档下，ESS-only 仍应优于 dual。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Domain-skewed 下 adaptive 的相对优势略增，但不改变 worst 档结论。\"\n\n  - name: \"Downstream eval (MMLU/HellaSwag)\"\n    plan_id: \"p2_downstream_eval\"\n    description: \"Llama-3.2-3B checkpoints 的下游任务评估\"\n    expected_results:\n      mmlu_uniform: 25.2\n      mmlu_adaptive: 25.3\n      hellaswag_uniform: 38.5\n      hellaswag_adaptive: 38.6\n    result_rationale: >\n      PPL 差异 0.02 在下游任务上几乎不可分辨。MMLU 和 HellaSwag 的改善在噪声范围内\n      （±0.5 point），无法声称 downstream 改善。在 worst 档下，PPL 的微弱差异 \n      不传导到 downstream metrics。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"下游任务改善不显著，与 worst 档 PPL 效应量一致。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # 综合分析\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Aggregate analysis — worst tier\"\n    plan_id: \"aggregate\"\n    description: \"全实验综合分析与 narrative pivot\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_dual_seed42: 17.650\n      eval_ppl_ess_only_seed42: 17.635\n      delta_dual_vs_ess_only: -0.015\n      tau_sweep_ppl_range: 0.040\n      tau_sweep_ppl_std: 0.015\n      eval_ppl_golden_ratio_seed42: 17.625\n      eval_ppl_nmin1_seed42: 17.632\n      rho06_delta_adaptive_vs_uniform: 0.013\n      rho06_adaptive_ppl: 18.55\n      mvp_ratio_aggregate: 68\n    result_rationale: >\n      所有指标落在 worst 档定义的关键指标范围内：\n      - dual PPL 17.650 ∈ [17.64, 17.66] ✓\n      - ESS-only PPL 17.635 ∈ [17.62, 17.64] ✓  \n      - delta -0.015 ∈ [-0.04, -0.01] ✓ (ESS-only 更优)\n      - τ sweep range 0.040 → std ≈ 0.015，无 plateau ✓\n      - Golden Ratio 17.625 ∈ [17.60, 17.64] ✓\n      - n_min=1 17.632 ∈ [17.62, 17.65] ✓\n      - ρ=0.6 Δ adaptive 0.013 ∈ [0.01, 0.03] ✓\n      - ρ=0.6 adaptive PPL 18.55 ∈ [18.4, 19.0] ✓\n      - MVP ratio (recalculated with ESS-only as reference) ~68 ∈ [50, 75] ✓\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Complete methods ranking (seed42, ρ=0.4)\"\n        headers: [\"Rank\", \"Method\", \"eval_ppl\", \"Δ vs uniform\", \"需额外成本\"]\n        rows:\n          - [1, \"Golden Ratio oracle\", 17.625, -0.065, \"已知比例\"]\n          - [2, \"n_min=1 (quasi-unconstrained)\", 17.632, -0.058, \"无\"]\n          - [3, \"ESS-only adaptive\", 17.635, -0.055, \"无\"]\n          - [4, \"Dual adaptive (τ=0.5)\", 17.640, -0.050, \"无\"]\n          - [5, \"batch_size=16 dual\", 17.646, -0.044, \"无\"]\n          - [6, \"batch_size=8 dual\", 17.648, -0.042, \"无\"]\n          - [7, \"Dual adaptive (τ=0.8, default)\", 17.650, -0.040, \"无\"]\n          - [8, \"Grid-best (b=0.5)\", 17.651, -0.039, \"Grid search\"]\n          - [9, \"Dual adaptive (τ=0.9)\", 17.680, -0.010, \"无\"]\n          - [10, \"Detect-and-remove\", 17.670, -0.020, \"无\"]\n          - [11, \"Uniform\", 17.690, \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [12, \"Random reweight\", 17.710, +0.020, \"无\"]\n      - name: \"Claim status under worst tier\"\n        headers: [\"Claim\", \"Original status\", \"Worst-tier status\", \"Action\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Claim 1 (dual-constraint)\", \"Core\", \"FAILED — α_eff harmful\", \"Pivot: ESS-only as main method, dual as negative finding\"]\n          - [\"Claim 2 (免调参)\", \"PASS (88.6%)\", \"WEAKENED (~68%)\", \"Reframe: ESS-only 也免调参且更优\"]\n          - [\"Claim 3 (unknown proportion)\", \"Pending τ sweep\", \"CHALLENGED — τ sensitive\", \"τ sweep 作为 negative evidence\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 1: α_eff(b) 和 ESS(b) 双轴图 → 保留，但 reframe 为 'why min-intervention fails'\"\n      - \"Figure 2: Methods ranking waterfall chart — Golden Ratio > ESS-only > Dual > Grid > Uniform\"\n      - \"Figure 3: τ sensitivity — PPL 单调递增，无 plateau，annotation: 'α_eff constraint is uniformly harmful'\"\n      - \"Figure 4: Detector quality × method interaction — α_eff 在 weak detector 下有害，strong detector 下无效\"\n      - \"Figure 5: ρ=0.4 vs ρ=0.6 效应量对比 — effect does not scale with contamination\"\n    analysis: >\n      Worst 档的核心叙事：\n\n      1. **ESS-only adaptive b* 是简单有效的主方法**——per-batch 自适应消除 grid search，\n         PPL 17.635 优于 grid-best 17.651，且无需任何超参（n_min 只需设一个宽松值如 2）。\n      \n      2. **α_eff 质量下界约束是 negative finding**——min-intervention 不优于 max-intervention。\n         根本原因：在 detector calibration 不完美时（AUC=0.939），q-score 的噪声使得 \n         α_eff 阈值化保留的 \"borderline\" 样本实际质量可疑。α_eff 的保守干预保留了过多 \n         noisy samples，反而有害。\n      \n      3. **τ 高度敏感**——PPL 随 τ 单调递增，无 plateau region，最优方向是消除 α_eff 约束。\n         这使得 τ 不是 \"insensitive default\"，而是需要仔细调节的超参——而最优调节结果 \n         等价于不用 α_eff。\n      \n      4. **论文 reframe 为 empirical study of adaptive importance weighting**：\n         - Contribution 1: ESS-only adaptive b* 消除 grid search\n         - Contribution 2: α_eff negative finding + detector quality interaction analysis\n         - Contribution 3: Lightweight detector sufficiency (TF-IDF+LR 即可)\n         - Contribution 4: Loss reweighting vs SIR 的实证对比\n      \n      5. **仍可冲 EMNLP**：negative finding 本身有价值（explains when/why quality floor \n         constraints fail），ESS-only adaptive 是实用贡献。需补做 ESS-only × 3 seeds \n         + ρ=0.6 ESS-only 来支撑新主方法。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"d5f8633e-2816-4397-b5fc-79fcaadc8881","total_cost_usd":0.48357825000000004,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":22799,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":12692,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":22799,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":12692,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":22799,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":22799},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":17759,"outputTokens":19,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.017854000000000002,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":12692,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":22799,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.46572425000000006,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mo